{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾正準備進行新一輪裁員，其全球IT部門可能有多達數百名員工面臨崗位削減。與近期許多科技公司不同，英特爾此次並未將人工智能列為裁員原因，而是將這一輪人員調整歸入行政總裁陳立武持續推動的精簡組織、降低成本的改革之中。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587294.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:43:55.840369+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T12:21:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T12:37:15.134684+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T12:37:15.134684+00:00","content_hash":"f823b71838021b6995fa675d36fc764f3d5f50fd1c9888b35366b8517d18a1d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}